  {
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Picked up after more than 30 s",
   "description": "Placed → picked up: from the order's start (when it reached main; a scheduled order from the moment the Pi rings it) to the Pi's order.ack. How many orders took longer than 30 s in the selected range. Each of those raised the not-picked-up alert.",
